# Project
~/.claude_task_runner/
*.cap
!tests/fixtures/usage/*.cap

# Per-task git worktrees created inside the repo (Claude Code / the runner's
# own dispatch hooks put one here per task). They are checkouts, not sources.
# Left untracked-but-not-ignored they show in `git status` forever, and any
# tooling that treats a dirty tree as "do not touch" — including the
# housekeeping pass's fast-forward of the default branch — silently declines
# to act. Scoped to worktrees/ so tracked .claude/ config stays tracked.
.claude/worktrees/
